    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome, dear audience, to the eve of your mightily awaited Eighth Dossoles Warrior Champion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we part the curtains, why don't we invite our beloved Mayor Candela up for the opening speech?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Citizens, tourists, with great pride in this city, I welcome you to Dossoles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter where you're from. It doesn't matter who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've made it here, so let all that fall away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enjoy everything our city has to give you. Enjoy everything you deserve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be happy, laugh happy, shout and scream happy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the paradise I built, and it's all for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now come! The most unforgettable time of your life is here for the taking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, big thank-you to Mayor Candela for that speech, just as sempiternally scorched with passion, alright. Moving on, time to introduce your contestants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lots of familiar faces this year and last year, but plenty of new ones too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "First order of business, they look like a lovey-dovey couple, they ARE a lovey-dovey couple, but they're a force on the fighting front!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honey Summer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "name2": "avg_npc_202",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The power of love brought us together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "name2": "avg_npc_202",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The power of love brought us our love.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "name2": "avg_npc_202",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "The power of our love is unmatched!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male & Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even I can barely stand before that sparkly power of love! Let's see just how far love's legs can run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Solo unit up next, the contestant who won the Stomach King Prelims, Mizuki!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Harmless as he looks, he ate through an entire restaurant warehouse. That bottomless stomach and that blue hair are begging to synergize with the ocean here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pacer-man!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hallo, hallo, hey everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Contestant Mizuki, would you like to say a few words to stir the hearts of the people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... I'll eat you all up once I'm tired of playing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooooh! Contestant Mizuki, utterer of terrifying statements in completely normal voices! We look forward to seeing you out there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Next up, it's a local team, led by Miss Rafaela, who may look cute, but she's got a giant, fiendish sickle. That's the kind of contrast this team's here to feed you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's welcome up\u2014the Grey Feathers!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello to you all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Rafaela, what do you have to say before the tournament?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... I'll do my best.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh, alright, alright, sometimes it's the simple things that touch us deep! Grey Feathers, I think you'll go far!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right after that, it's a newcomer to this competition, but the team that's drawn the most buzz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "They're the live scrimmage gatecrashers, winners with an attitude no-one could answer, the supernovas who've picked up Mr. Pancho's support!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "They came from a place the City of Two Suns loves dearly\u2014the Lungmen heroines, Miss Lin Y\u00fchsia, Miss Ch'en Hui-chieh, and we even get the local arms dealer, Mr. Ernesto, completing this team\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014LUNG wRATh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Strong, fresh teams spike an appetite like nothing else, and their odds are sitting high! But! Do you truly dare to put your chips down on them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, let's get your statement. Team leader?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's the leader?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ernesto, you do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way Lin Y\u00fchsia's going to take what I say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you wouldn't take what I say either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, we proclaim\u2014we're going to carve our mark into this competition's history!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How was that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mediocre.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Agreed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thought so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Massively assertive! Let's look forward to LUNG wRATh and their vivid display.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Moving on, our next team is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebgtween",
        "xFrom": -720,
        "xTo": -180,
        "duration": 1,
        "ease": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Missy, this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming! Hey, watch my ice cream!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, this crowd is insane...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just goes to show how much attention's on this contest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, you see that? Ch'en's carrying some gun-ish thing for some reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guess she's not planning to use her sword this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's set herself up badly, hasn't she? She was about as good at firearms training as I was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow. Excellence doesn't just grow on trees, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Calling her swordsmanship 'excellent' undersells it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Missy, I gotta say, you're an even bigger Ch'en fan than me, behind her back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just stating facts, okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, yeah. More importantly, though, seeing Ch'en without a sword is a sight to treasure. Let's go ask the organizers if we can get a recording of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not. That would be hell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's to be so embarrassed about? We'll cut it into a flick. I've already got the title. It'll be 'Gunslinger Old Ch'en Grasps Great Lung Power.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I gotta say, you might have a talent for directing awful B movies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm flattered. Oh, right, Missy. I've got something to talk to you about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not happening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, I haven't even said what it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You said 'something to talk about' and I nearly threw up my ice cream. Nothing good comes out of that phrasing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey. No, just, I saw the officials here had an event on for the spectators.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I looked into it. They let you guess who'll win. And there's a bunch of smaller ones, like who'll be first to get gold, who'll get eliminated earliest, and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The way you use the word 'guess' absolutely floors me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's government-sponsored. Ship-shape and legal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh. What even goes for illegal in this city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah... good point, but right now we're just regular tourists, y'know? It's beyond our job descriptions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And look, even if you want to laugh at Ch'en and Miss Lin, just suppose they do win, we won't be out of pocket, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Makes it a win-win, Missy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh*... I give in. Here's my card.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mighty thanks, Milady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't go splashing it about!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebgtween",
        "xFrom": -180,
        "xTo": -720,
        "duration": 1,
        "ease": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, that's all forty teams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Cameras and drones will capture the whole thing, ensuring you don't miss a single beautiful shot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "And this main stage isn't gonna stand alone, either. The officials have set up ten more, each one with its own dedicated presenter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "So you'll get every second, and with commentary just as brilliant to match.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Plus, once the opening ceremony begins, we've got a little wagering opportuntiy for you audience-siders, to make the competition that much spicier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "All spectators are invited to register your info on the government site, and you can make yourself a little extra cash!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "For specifics on how it'll work, refer to your government-issued competition guides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, then. All the competitors are in our starting district and readied up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Round 1 will be a search\u2014and a struggle\u2014for pure gold in a partitioned-off area. Teams will then hand it directly to staff at the finish point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, they're also allowed to shoot for more! Whatever gold they get belongs to them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright! Mayor Candela, fire off the salute and signal the start of this competition!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I declare\u2014Round 1 has officially begun!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
