    },
    {
        "text": "What now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We split up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And avoid working together. It seems we have yet another common understanding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, before that. We're already being watched.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
